# PRODUCTION secrets of the website Worker (bukuresipi-web) -> `bun run secrets:push` (copy to .env, git-ignored).
# Cloudflare never returns secret values, so .env is the only copy you can read back.
# Empty values are skipped, so a blank line never wipes a live secret.
# None yet: the site is static. Add one here when the Worker reads it (worker/index.ts `env`), e.g. a Turnstile
# secret for a form. NOT here: PUBLIC_* build settings - they are public and go in .env.production.

# TURNSTILE_SECRET=
